 "stimulus_html": "Given <span data-math=\"p\">p</span>: Yellow is a primary color, <span data-math=\"q\">q</span>: Blue is a primary color, and <span data-math=\"r\">r</span>: Green is a primary color, determine the truth value of each conjunction.",
