     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Given statements:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\"></span>: Yellow is a primary color.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\"></span> is true.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"q\"></span>: Blue is a primary color.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"q\"></span> is true.</p>\n<p>The <span data-math=\"\\wedge\"></span> symbol represents the conjunction and is translated “and” or “but.”</p>\n<p>A conjunction is only true when both statements are true.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"p \\wedge q\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\rm True} \\wedge {\\rm True}={\\rm True}\"></span></p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "True"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
