     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Given statements:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\"></span>: Yellow is a primary color.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\"></span> is true.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"r\"></span>: Green is a primary color.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"r\"></span> is false.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\sim}r\"></span> is true.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\sim}r \\wedge p\"></span></p>\n<p>A conjunction is only true when both statements are true.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\rm True \\wedge True = True\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "False"
    }
   ],
